Open the int8-QK prefill-attn dispatch for Ornith-1.5-9B.

patches/triton-prefill-attn-int8.patch gates the Triton kernel on Qwen3.8-27B
geometry (24 q-heads / 4 kv-heads / D=256). Ornith-1.5-9B is the same D and
Hkv with 16 q-heads (G=4). The kernel already takes G from hq//hkv; without
this follow-up, PREFILL_ATTN=int8 is a silent FA2 no-op on Ornith.

Apply AFTER triton-prefill-attn-int8.patch (this name sorts later).
  patch -p1 -d venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm < patches/triton-prefill-attn-ornith-heads.patch

--- a/v1/attention/backends/flash_attn.py
